  "system": {
    "localizationKey": "REDSTEEL.Items.Riposte.name",
    "description": "<p>Instead of defending, make an attack roll against your opponent's Margin of Success (MoS).</p><ul data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"334\"><li data-section-id=\"1u63nsv\" data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"187\"><p>If you win, the opponent's attack is canceled.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1o4qxda\" data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"277\"><p>Then resolve your attack normally, treating the opponent's MoS as their defense result.</p></li><li data-section-id=\"1dwx6h4\" data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"334\"><p>If you fail, the opponent's attack proceeds as normal against your MoS as your defense result.</p></li></ul><p></p>",
